"Reservation amounts are for the room only (room_without_vat, "
"room_with_vat) and the services of that reservation. In folios with "
"several rooms the price can be set on only one reservation and the others "
"show 0: use the totals of the folio."
msgstr ""

#. module: pms_ai_tool_support
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_support/models/pms_folio_notifications.py:0
msgid ""
"Rule: the notification rule that created the log; empty for a manual send "
"or when the rule was deleted."
msgstr ""

#. module: pms_ai_tool_support
#. odoo-python
